// Quiz for {Fill_in_Here} topic

::JOIN::
What is a join?{
~The SQL Join clause is used to establish foreign key relationships.
~The SQL Join clause is used to combine information and store it as a new table in our database.
=The SQL Join clause is used to combine records (rows) from two or more tables in a SQL database based on a related column between the two.
~The SQL Join clause can only perform INNER JOINs and is rather inconsistently used.
}

